# The configuration is oculus's own: regrouped one concern to a file in O10c, written in the
# two-space style the cockpit's copies arrived in and kept there so a key still reads beside the
# comment block that explains it. A formatter pass would rewrite the indentation and the comment
# columns of all eight. meta.yml is not listed: it is oculus's own from the start and is formatted.
# manifest-schema.yml carries the form's structure as well as its words since O11 (`type`, `section`,
# `from`, `options` per field), so it is no longer the cockpit's file with different words in it.
# The demo hub is data, not source: it is the cockpit's dummy/ ported across, and a formatter pass
# would rewrite the indentation and the quoting of every manifest and every collection file, which is
# what tests/data/demo-hub.test.ts and the browser specs read.
